; @xors-software/* are private packages in the org's GitHub Packages registry.
; Installs (local + Railway build) authenticate with NODE_AUTH_TOKEN — a GitHub
; token with read:packages. Set it in the deploy env (Railway: one var per service).
@xors-software:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${NODE_AUTH_TOKEN}
